  91:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4_hal_lowlevel.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the RCC Oscillators according to the specified parameters in the
  92:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4_hal_lowlevel.c ****   *         RCC_OscInitTypeDef.
