 401:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4_hal_lowlevel.c **** /**
 402:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4_hal_lowlevel.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the CPU, AHB and APB busses clocks according to the specified
