 380:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/CMSIS/core/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Wait For Interrupt
 381:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/CMSIS/core/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Wait For Interrupt is a hint instruction that suspends execution until one of a number o
