 410:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/CMSIS/core/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 411:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/CMSIS/core/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Instruction Synchronization Barrier
 412:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/CMSIS/core/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Instruction Synchronization Barrier flushes the pipeline in the processor,
